{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "防御清单",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 109.34,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "把这些根因倒过来，就是防御。",
   "spoken": "把这些根因倒过来，就是防御。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 4.007
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "先看验证者。门限要高于三分之二。",
   "spoken": "先看验证者。门限要高于三分之二。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 4.46,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 4.46,
   "speechEnd": 8.139
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "签名人在组织、地域和基础设施上都要独立，并且定期核对签名权清单。",
   "spoken": "签名人在组织、地域和基础设施上都要独立，并且定期核对签名权清单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 8.6,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 8.6,
   "speechEnd": 15.764
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "再看消息。消息里要写明源链、源合约、目标链、目标合约和序号，目标侧逐项核对。",
   "spoken": "再看消息。消息里要写明源链、源合约、目标链、目标合约和序号，目标侧逐项核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 16.18,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 16.18,
   "speechEnd": 24.621
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "处理过的消息要打上标记，防止重放。",
   "spoken": "楚理过的消息要打上标记，防止虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 25.04,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 25.135,
   "speechEnd": 28.21
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "证明验证代码要有独立审计和测试向量。零值、空数组、没初始化的根，都不能当作有效证明。",
   "spoken": "证明验证代码要有独立审计和测试向量。零值、空数组、没初始化的根，都不能荡作有效证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 28.62,
   "dur": 8.96,
   "speechStart": 28.717,
   "speechEnd": 37.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "Merkle 树的叶子和中间节点，要用不同的哈希前缀。",
   "spoken": "Merkle 树的叶子和中间节点，要用不同的哈希前缀。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 37.8,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 37.896,
   "speechEnd": 41.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "执行消息时，目标地址和函数走白名单，不许碰特权合约。",
   "spoken": "执行消息时，目标地址和函数走白名单，不许碰特权合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 42.02,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 42.113,
   "speechEnd": 46.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "然后是限额。单笔和单位时间的提款都有上限，超过就进延迟队列。",
   "spoken": "然后是限额。单笔和单位时间的提款都有上限，超过就进延迟队列。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 47.04,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 47.14,
   "speechEnd": 53.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "监控两侧的总量。A 链锁定的，要不少于 B 链铸造的。对不上，就自动暂停。",
   "spoken": "监控两侧的总量。A 链锁定的，要不少于 B 链铸造的。对不上，就自动暂停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 53.66,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 53.66,
   "speechEnd": 59.288
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "最后是升级。桥合约升级必须经过时间锁，初始化参数必须审计。",
   "spoken": "最后是升级。桥合约升级必须经过时间锁，初始化参数必须审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 59.72,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 59.72,
   "speechEnd": 65.849
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "同样的问题，也出现在交易所的充值系统里。",
   "spoken": "同样的问题，也出现在交易所的充值系统里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 66.26,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 66.26,
   "speechEnd": 69.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "交易所相信链上发生了一笔转账，然后在内部账本上记账。这也是一座桥。",
   "spoken": "交易所相信链上发生了一笔转账，然后在内部账本上记账。这也是一座桥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 69.92,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 69.92,
   "speechEnd": 76.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "假币合约会发出同名的转账事件。所以要核对代币合约地址，不看名称和符号。",
   "spoken": "假币合约会发出同名的转账事件。所以要核对代币合约地址，不看名称和符号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 76.46,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 76.46,
   "speechEnd": 83.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，转账失败的交易，比如能量不足，仍然会上链，也有交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，转账失败的交易，比如能量不足，仍然会上链，也有交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 84.04,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 84.04,
   "speechEnd": 90.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "只看交易存在就入账，就会出现假充值。要先确认回执状态是成功，再看事件。",
   "spoken": "只看交易存在就入账，就会出现假充值。要先确认回执状态是成功，再看事件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 90.82,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 90.82,
   "speechEnd": 97.434
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "同一笔交易，用交易哈希加日志序号做幂等键，防止重复入账。",
   "spoken": "同一笔交易，用交易哈希加日志序号做幂等键，防止虫复入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 97.84,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 97.937,
   "speechEnd": 102.987
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "入账前等够确认数，防止源链重组把这笔交易抹掉。",
   "spoken": "入账前等够确认数，防止源链虫组把这笔交易抹掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 103.42,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 103.515,
   "speechEnd": 107.913
  }
